#: ../../functions/func_add.rst:6
msgid "$add"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_add.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$add(x,y,\\*args)**"
msgstr "用法：**$add(x,y,\\*args)**"

#: ../../functions/func_add.rst:9
msgid "Category: mathematical"
msgstr "类别：数学"

#: ../../functions/func_add.rst:11
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_add.rst:13
msgid "Adds ``y`` to ``x``. Can be used with an arbitrary number of arguments (i.e.: ``$add(x,y,z)`` = (x + y) + z). Returns an empty string if an argument is missing or not an integer."
msgstr ""
"将 ``y`` 加到 ``x``。可以与任意数量的参数一起使用（即：``$add(x,y,z)`` = (x "
"+ y) + z）。如果参数缺失或不是整数，则返回空字符串。"

